  <entry>
    <title>两张盖过章的付款条 —— ECDSA nonce 重用伪造提款条</title>
    <link href="/shiyan/2026/11/14/writeup-ecdsa-nonce-reuse/"/>
    <url>/shiyan/2026/11/14/writeup-ecdsa-nonce-reuse/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><strong>Flag：<code>flag{x47_62c45a6f383e}</code></strong></p><p>一句话：两条付款签名用了同一个 ECDSA nonce（<code>r1 == r2</code>），由此恢复私钥，再给空白的提款条补一个合法签名。</p></blockquote><hr><h2 id="1-题目与入口"><a href="#1-题目与入口" class="headerlink" title="1. 题目与入口"></a>1. 题目与入口</h2><p>平台开启了 <strong>TCP over WebSocket</strong> 代理：把 <code>wss://…/api/proxy/&lt;uuid&gt;</code> 用 <code>wsrx connect</code> 拉到本地端口，再 <code>nc 127.0.0.1 &lt;port&gt;</code> 即可。本质是一个一次性交互的密码学服务：连上后先吐一段 banner，然后<strong>只读一行输入</strong>，答对给 flag，答错回 <code>no</code> 并断开。</p><p>banner 长这样（每次连接都会重新生成密钥，所以数值每次都不同）：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><div class="code-wrapper"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></div></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">curve=secp256k1<br>hash=sha256d<br>p=fffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffefffffc2f<br>n=fffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffebaaedce6af48a03bbfd25e8cd0364141<br>a=0<br>b=7<br>Gx=79be667ef9dcbbac55a06295ce870b07029bfcdb2dce28d959f2815b16f81798<br>Gy=483ada7726a3c4655da4fbfc0e1108a8fd17b448a68554199c47d08ffb10d4b8<br>Qx=da974c13cbf61014ca86e8619894048b029b1bd8a8547c379b23effc8c00425b<br>Qy=acbff4364a0cccce5f44014f086eabceb9249a43a69f3a66a7d43ed7e14fa16c<br>slip1=pay|from=desk|to=north|coin=100000000|n=1<br>r1=119975d9fdeaf96a356a301b2b2538068462bd4b1dde68b78c89b128352ab185<br>s1=26c66e65ecc3fd95e3a39e55cf8c870a799f8e6576a401047c7455e10929bd9d<br>slip2=pay|from=desk|to=south|coin=250000000|n=2<br>r2=119975d9fdeaf96a356a301b2b2538068462bd4b1dde68b78c89b128352ab185<br>s2=e35c944cbd03e2e37edafc9a4c30a996e917482556b7402689cdc5985454bd39<br>withdraw=withdraw|from=desk|to=bearer|coin=all|n=9<br>end<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><table><thead><tr><th>字段</th><th>含义</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>curve</code> &#x2F; <code>p,a,b,Gx,Gy,n</code></td><td>secp256k1 全部参数，直接照抄即可</td></tr><tr><td><code>hash=sha256d</code></td><td>签名时对消息做 <strong>SHA256(SHA256(msg))</strong>，取 32 字节大端整数再 mod n</td></tr><tr><td><code>Qx,Qy</code></td><td>服务端公钥（私钥未知）</td></tr><tr><td><code>slip1/slip2 + r,s</code></td><td>两张<strong>已经盖过章</strong>（已签名）的付款条</td></tr><tr><td><code>withdraw</code></td><td>还空着、等待盖章的提款条</td></tr></tbody></table><p>题目文案里的“章”就是 ECDSA 签名，“两张已经盖过章的付款条”就是两组 <code>(r, s)</code>。</p><hr><h2 id="2-漏洞点：r1-r2"><a href="#2-漏洞点：r1-r2" class="headerlink" title="2. 漏洞点：r1 == r2"></a>2. 漏洞点：<code>r1 == r2</code></h2><p>ECDSA 签名：</p><figure class="highlight dns"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs dns">r = <span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>k·G<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>.x mod n<br>s = k⁻¹ · <span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>z + r·d<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span> mod n        // z = H<span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>msg<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>, d 为私钥<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>r</code> 只由 nonce <code>k</code> 决定。两张付款条的 <code>r</code> 一模一样，说明服务端<strong>两次签名复用了同一个 k</strong>。于是同一个 <code>k</code> 出现在两个方程里：</p><figure class="highlight dns"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs dns">s1·k = z1 + r·d  <span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>mod n<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br>s2·k = z2 + r·d  <span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>mod n<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>两式相减，<code>d</code> 被消掉：</p><figure class="highlight dns"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs dns">k = <span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>z1 − z2<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span> · <span class="hljs-punctuation">(</span>s1 − s2<span class="hljs-punctuation">)</span>⁻¹  mod n<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>再把 <code>k</code> 代回任一式：</p><figure class="highlight abnf"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs abnf"><span class="hljs-attribute">d</span> <span class="hljs-operator">=</span> (s1·k − z1) · r1⁻¹  mod n<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>私钥到手，任何消息都能盖章。</p><h3 id="自检（很重要）"><a href="#自检（很重要）" class="headerlink" title="自检（很重要）"></a>自检（很重要）</h3><p>算完先验证 <code>d·G == Q</code>。这一步同时校验了三件事：哈希口径（是 <code>sha256d</code> 而不是单次 SHA256）、消息字节（是否带换行&#x2F;空格）、曲线参数。本题里第一次算就精确等于 banner 的 <code>Q</code>，说明口径全对。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-keyword">assert</span> point_mul(d, G) == Q<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="3-给提款条盖章"><a href="#3-给提款条盖章" class="headerlink" title="3. 给提款条盖章"></a>3. 给提款条盖章</h2><p>待签消息就是 banner 里 <code>withdraw=</code> 后面的原样字符串（UTF-8，无换行）：</p><figure class="highlight coq"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs coq">withdraw|<span class="hljs-type">from</span>=desk|<span class="hljs-type">to</span>=bearer|<span class="hljs-type">coin</span>=all|<span class="hljs-type">n</span>=<span class="hljs-number">9</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>用恢复出的 <code>d</code> 重新签一次，nonce 可以随便取新的（复用原来的 <code>k</code> 也行，验证方不关心）：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python">z  = sha256d(msg)<br>kk = randbelow(n-<span class="hljs-number">1</span>) + <span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>r  = (kk·G).x mod n<br>s  = kk⁻¹ · (z + r·d) mod n<br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> s &gt; n//<span class="hljs-number">2</span>: s = n - s      <span class="hljs-comment"># 规范化成 low-s，兼容严格校验器</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="4-交互协议：只读一行"><a href="#4-交互协议：只读一行" class="headerlink" title="4. 交互协议：只读一行"></a>4. 交互协议：只读一行</h2><p>这是本题最容易卡住的地方——<strong>协议细节 banner 里没写</strong>。</p><p>实测结论：</p><ol><li><p>服务端<strong>只读一行</strong>（<code>readline</code> 语义），读到换行才处理；只发数据不带 <code>\n</code> 会一直挂着。</p></li><li><p>提交格式是<strong>一行、空格分隔的两个 64 位十六进制数</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">&lt;r_hex&gt; &lt;s_hex&gt;\n<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li><li><p>中间用 <code>\t</code> 分隔同样能过（解析器按空白切分）。</p></li><li><p>其他写法一律回 <code>no</code> 并断开，包括：<code>r=…,s=…</code>、<code>r=…\ns=…</code>、<code>&lt;r&gt;&lt;s&gt;</code> 拼接、JSON、DER 编码、只交私钥&#x2F;<code>k</code> 等。</p></li></ol><blockquote><p>判定“只读一行”的小技巧：先发 <code>r=&lt;合法 64 位 hex&gt;\n</code> 但<strong>不发 s</strong>。若服务端在等第二行，会超时无响应；若只读一行，会立刻回 <code>no</code>。本题是后者。再配合“不带换行则必超时”，就能确定协议是单行 <code>readline</code>。</p></blockquote><p>另一个坑：<strong>每次连接都重新生成密钥</strong>，banner 里的 <code>Q</code>、<code>r1</code>、<code>s1</code>、<code>s2</code> 每次都不一样。所以“先连一次拿数据、算完再连一次提交”必然失败——恢复私钥、签名、提交必须在<strong>同一条连接</strong>内完成。</p><hr><h2 id="5-完整脚本"><a href="#5-完整脚本" class="headerlink" title="5. 完整脚本"></a>5. 完整脚本</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-comment">#!/usr/bin/env python3</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"># -*- coding: utf-8 -*-</span><br><span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;&quot;ECDSA nonce 重用 -&gt; 伪造提款条</span><br><span class="hljs-string">用法: python solve.py &quot;wss://host/api/proxy/&lt;uuid&gt;&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-string">依赖: pip install websockets</span><br><span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> asyncio, hashlib, secrets, ssl, sys<br><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> websockets<br><br>P  = <span class="hljs-number">0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFEFFFFFC2F</span><br>N  = <span class="hljs-number">0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFEBAAEDCE6AF48A03BBFD25E8CD0364141</span><br>GX = <span class="hljs-number">0x79BE667EF9DCBBAC55A06295CE870B07029BFCDB2DCE28D959F2815B16F81798</span><br>GY = <span class="hljs-number">0x483ADA7726A3C4655DA4FBFC0E1108A8FD17B448A68554199C47D08FFB10D4B8</span><br>G  = (GX, GY)<br><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">point_add</span>(<span class="hljs-params">A, B</span>):<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> A <span class="hljs-keyword">is</span> <span class="hljs-literal">None</span>: <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> B<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> B <span class="hljs-keyword">is</span> <span class="hljs-literal">None</span>: <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> A<br>    x1, y1 = A; x2, y2 = B<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> x1 == x2 <span class="hljs-keyword">and</span> (y1 + y2) % P == <span class="hljs-number">0</span>: <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">None</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> A == B: lam = <span class="hljs-number">3</span> * x1 * x1 * <span class="hljs-built_in">pow</span>(<span class="hljs-number">2</span> * y1, -<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, P) % P<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:      lam = (y2 - y1) * <span class="hljs-built_in">pow</span>(x2 - x1, -<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, P) % P<br>    x3 = (lam * lam - x1 - x2) % P<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> x3, (lam * (x1 - x3) - y1) % P<br><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">point_mul</span>(<span class="hljs-params">k, A</span>):<br>    R = <span class="hljs-literal">None</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> k:<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> k &amp; <span class="hljs-number">1</span>: R = point_add(R, A)<br>        A = point_add(A, A); k &gt;&gt;= <span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> R<br><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">sha256d</span>(<span class="hljs-params">msg: <span class="hljs-built_in">bytes</span></span>) -&gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>:<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>.from_bytes(hashlib.sha256(hashlib.sha256(msg).digest()).digest(), <span class="hljs-string">&quot;big&quot;</span>) % N<br><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">async</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">solve</span>(<span class="hljs-params">url: <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span></span>) -&gt; <span class="hljs-built_in">str</span>:<br>    ctx = ssl.create_default_context()<br>    ctx.check_hostname = <span class="hljs-literal">False</span><br>    ctx.verify_mode = ssl.CERT_NONE<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">async</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">with</span> websockets.connect(url, ssl=ctx, open_timeout=<span class="hljs-number">15</span>, ping_interval=<span class="hljs-literal">None</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">as</span> ws:<br>        banner = <span class="hljs-string">b&quot;&quot;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> <span class="hljs-string">b&quot;end\n&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">not</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> banner:<br>            banner += <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> asyncio.wait_for(ws.recv(), timeout=<span class="hljs-number">15</span>)<br>        info = <span class="hljs-built_in">dict</span>(l.split(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;=&quot;</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> l <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> banner.decode().splitlines() <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;=&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> l)<br><br>        r1, s1, s2 = <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(info[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;r1&quot;</span>], <span class="hljs-number">16</span>), <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(info[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;s1&quot;</span>], <span class="hljs-number">16</span>), <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(info[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;s2&quot;</span>], <span class="hljs-number">16</span>)<br>        Q = (<span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(info[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Qx&quot;</span>], <span class="hljs-number">16</span>), <span class="hljs-built_in">int</span>(info[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Qy&quot;</span>], <span class="hljs-number">16</span>))<br><br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 1) 同一 nonce 复用 -&gt; 恢复 k 与私钥 d</span><br>        z1 = sha256d(info[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;slip1&quot;</span>].encode())<br>        z2 = sha256d(info[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;slip2&quot;</span>].encode())<br>        k = (z1 - z2) * <span class="hljs-built_in">pow</span>(s1 - s2, -<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, N) % N<br>        d = (s1 * k - z1) * <span class="hljs-built_in">pow</span>(r1, -<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, N) % N<br><br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 2) 自检</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">assert</span> point_mul(d, G) == Q, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;私钥恢复失败:检查 hash 与消息字节&quot;</span><br><br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 3) 给提款条签名</span><br>        z = sha256d(info[<span class="hljs-string">&quot;withdraw&quot;</span>].encode())<br>        kk = secrets.randbelow(N - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) + <span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>        r = point_mul(kk, G)[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>] % N<br>        s = <span class="hljs-built_in">pow</span>(kk, -<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, N) * (z + r * d) % N<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> s &gt; N // <span class="hljs-number">2</span>: s = N - s<br><br>        <span class="hljs-comment"># 4) 单行提交: &quot;&lt;r_hex&gt; &lt;s_hex&gt;&quot;</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> ws.send(<span class="hljs-string">f&quot;<span class="hljs-subst">&#123;r:064x&#125;</span> <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;s:064x&#125;</span>\n&quot;</span>.encode())<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> (<span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> asyncio.wait_for(ws.recv(), timeout=<span class="hljs-number">10</span>)).decode().strip()<br><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> __name__ == <span class="hljs-string">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(asyncio.run(solve(sys.argv[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>])))<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>运行：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">python solve.py <span class="hljs-string">&quot;wss://ctf.example.com/api/proxy/xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx&quot;</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"># flag&#123;x47_62c45a6f383e&#125;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="6-时间线与踩坑记录"><a href="#6-时间线与踩坑记录" class="headerlink" title="6. 时间线与踩坑记录"></a>6. 时间线与踩坑记录</h2><ol><li>连上拿到 banner，<code>r1 == r2</code> 一眼看出 nonce 重用，公式三分钟推完。</li><li>卡在<strong>提交格式</strong>：先试 <code>r=…\ns=…</code>、<code>r=…,s=…</code>、拼接、JSON、DER，全部 <code>no</code>。</li><li>用“只发 <code>r=</code> 一行、不发 <code>s</code>”做对照实验，发现服务端<strong>只读一行</strong>，据此把搜索空间压到单行格式。</li><li>枚举分隔符时，<code>&quot;&lt;r&gt; &lt;s&gt;\n&quot;</code> 命中，返回 flag；再用 <code>\t</code> 分隔复现一次，确认解析器按空白切分。</li></ol><h2 id="7-修复建议"><a href="#7-修复建议" class="headerlink" title="7. 修复建议"></a>7. 修复建议</h2><ul><li><strong>每次签名必须使用密码学安全随机、且互不复用的 nonce</strong>（RFC 6979 确定性 nonce 也可）。</li><li>不要自己实现 ECDSA；用经过审计的库。</li><li>服务端不要泄露同一密钥下的重复 <code>r</code>；若已泄露，应立即轮换密钥。</li></ul>]]></content>
    
    
